@startuml
' Teaches every Gotoh layer transition, its consumption direction, and its cost.
title Exact affine-gap automaton layers

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam state {
  FontColor #0F172A
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  BorderColor #B45309
  FontColor #451A03
}

state "M / Normal\n(query index i, cost c)" as M #DBEAFE
state "I_x / AffineQueryGap\n(query index i, cost c)" as Ix #FCE7F3
state "I_y / AffineDictGap\n(query index i, cost c)" as Iy #FFF7ED

[*] --> M : initial state

M --> M : consume query + dictionary\nmatch 0 / substitution s
Ix --> M : consume query + dictionary\nmatch 0 / substitution s
Iy --> M : consume query + dictionary\nmatch 0 / substitution s

M --> Ix : consume query (epsilon)\nopen + extend: g_o + g_e
Iy --> Ix : consume query (epsilon)\nswitch + extend: g_o + g_e
Ix --> Ix : consume query (epsilon)\nextend: g_e

M --> Iy : consume dictionary edge\nopen + extend: g_o + g_e
Ix --> Iy : consume dictionary edge\nswitch + extend: g_o + g_e
Iy --> Iy : consume dictionary edge\nextend: g_e

M --> [*] : finish trailing query run\ng_o + r g_e
Iy --> [*] : finish trailing query run\ng_o + r g_e
Ix --> [*] : finish trailing query run\nr g_e (already open)

note right of Ix
  <latex>G(r)=g_o+r g_e</latex>
  Opening is charged once per contiguous run.
end note

legend left
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#DBEAFE> blue | diagonal / ordinary residual language |
  |<#FCE7F3> pink | query-consuming gap layer |
  |<#FFF7ED> orange | dictionary-consuming gap layer |
  |<#FEF3C7> amber | exact cost convention |
endlegend
@enduml
